## ── GlycanDock flags ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
## Source: Nance et al. 2021 Table S1
## GlycanDock-specific flags must be prefixed with -carbohydrates:glycan_dock:
## Cellotriose (3x BGC on chain X) docked into GH 76 (chain A)

## ── Required glycan handling ──────────────────────────────────────────────
-include_sugars
-alternate_3_letter_codes pdb_sugar
-maintain_links
## -maintain_links (not -auto_detect_glycan_connections): input PDB has LINK records
## already written (O4 Glc X 1 → C1 Glc X 2, O4 Glc X 2 → C1 Glc X 3).
## auto_detect uses distance scanning and finds "3 glycan linkages" (POLYMER_LOWER=0 crash).
## maintain_links reads LINK records directly → correct 2-bond GlycanTree. See Nance 2021 p.6809.
-lock_rings

## ── Docking partners ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-docking:partners A_X

## ── GlycanDock algorithm parameters ──────────────────────────────────────
## Starting from a docked pose: do NOT slide into contact
-carbohydrates:glycan_dock:slide_glycan_into_contact false
## Allow full Stage 1 perturbation + Stage 2 MCM (not refine-only)
-carbohydrates:glycan_dock:refine_only false
## Outer cycles controlling Stage 2 score ramping (default 10)
-n_cycles 10
## Stage 2 repeats if final model has no negative interface score (default 3)
-carbohydrates:glycan_dock:n_repeats 3
## Inner rigid-body rounds per outer cycle (default 8)
-carbohydrates:glycan_dock:n_rigid_body_rounds 8
## Inner torsion rounds per outer cycle (default 8)
-carbohydrates:glycan_dock:n_torsion_rounds 8

## ── General Rosetta options ───────────────────────────────────────────────
-run:version
-nblist_autoupdate
-linmem_ig 10

## ── Side-chain packing ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
-packing::extrachi_cutoff 1
-packing::ex1
-packing::ex2
-packing::ex1aro:level 6
-packing::use_input_sc
-packing::flip_HNQ
-packing::no_optH false
-packing::optH_MCA false

## ── Suppress irrelevant patch types ─────────────────────────────────────
-chemical:exclude_patches LowerDNA UpperDNA Cterm_amidation VirtualBB ShoveBB VirtualDNAPhosphate VirtualNTerm CTermConnect sc_orbitals pro_hydroxylated_case1 pro_hydroxylated_case2 ser_phosphorylated thr_phosphorylated tyr_phosphorylated tyr_sulfated lys_dimethylated lys_monomethylated lys_trimethylated lys_acetylated glu_carboxylated cys_acetylated tyr_diiodinated N_acetylated C_methylamidated MethylatedProteinCterm
